{"id":"Wa3f2569f64b1b8dc0ea582a2","zh":"模态综合","en":"","name":"模态综合","language":"zh","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","concept_id":"C37c836aa12061b96d052","families":[],"definition_zh":"利用子结构模态信息建立整体降阶动力模型的方法。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wa3f2569f64b1b8dc0ea582a2","text":"模态综合","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S84cf3cebc1c25ee26e73","source_id":"P133","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于动态子结构法中的固定界面模态综合法建立隧道−土体−上盖建筑二维有限元模型,通过与整体结构有限元模型计算结果对比,验证该方法在车致环境振动研究中的有效性,并探究人工边界的施加问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S5d1bf212fdf1597967d5","source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"在城市轨道交通环境振动的研究中,冯青松等 [22]将固定界面模态综合法应用于地铁车致建筑物的振动分析,并探究了 CMS 法在环境振动分析中的适用性、准确度与计算效率,同时研究了相关参数对建筑物振动的影响。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P133":{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W630dde983a644b8172543b26","name":"component mode synthesis method","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W630dde983a644b8172543b26","name":"component mode synthesis method","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W630dde983a644b8172543b26","name":"component mode synthesis method","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P13